# 统一换行符：仓库内一律按 LF 存储，检出也用 LF（含 Windows）。
# 原因是 lint 门禁按行比对 prettier，CRLF 会让每条 import 都报 "Delete ␍"，
# 门禁被噪声淹没（本地曾因此多出 800+ 条无关 warning）。CI 与本地从此一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不参与换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.m4a binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.node binary
*.asar binary
*.jar binary
*.dex binary
*.apk binary
*.pdf binary

# 安装脚本与锁文件：明确按 LF，避免 NSIS/yarn 在不同平台读到不同换行
*.nsh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 语言统计：锁文件不计入
yarn.lock linguist-generated=true
